            "question": {
              "en": {
                "comprehension": null,
                "direction": null,
                "content": "<p>A stone is projected vertically up with a velocity u, reaches upto a maximum height h. When it is at a height of $\\frac{3h}{4}$ from the ground, the ratio of KE and PE at that point is :</p><p>(consider PE = 0 at the point of projection)</p>",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "identifier": "A",
                    "content": "<p>1 : 1</p>"
                  },
                  {
                    "identifier": "B",
                    "content": "<p>1 : 2</p>"
                  },
                  {
                    "identifier": "C",
                    "content": "<p>1 : 3</p>"
                  },
                  {
                    "identifier": "D",
                    "content": "<p>3 : 1</p>"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "hi": {
                "comprehension": null,
                "direction": null,
                "content": "<p>एक पत्थर को ऊर्ध्वाधर ऊपर की ओर u वेग से प्रक्षेपित किया जाता है, जो अधिकतम ऊंचाई h तक पहुँचता है। जब यह जमीन से $\\frac{3h}{4}$ की ऊंचाई पर होता है, तो उस बिंदु पर इसकी गतिज ऊर्जा (KE) और स्थितिज ऊर्जा (PE) का अनुपात है :</p><p>(प्रक्षेपण बिंदु पर PE = 0 मान लें)</p>",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "identifier": "A",
                    "content": "<p>1 : 1</p>"
                  },
                  {
                    "identifier": "B",
                    "content": "<p>1 : 2</p>"
                  },
                  {
                    "identifier": "C",
                    "content": "<p>1 : 3</p>"
                  },
                  {
                    "identifier": "D",
                    "content": "<p>3 : 1</p>"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "subTopic": null,
            "subject": "physics",
            "timeAllotted": 90000,
            "topic": "mechanical-energy-conservation",
            "type": "mcq"
          },
