            "question": {
              "en": {
                "comprehension": null,
                "direction": null,
                "content": "<p>A block of mass m is attached to two unstretched springs of spring constants $k_1$ and $k_2$ as shown in figure. The block is displaced towards right through a distance $x$ and is released. Find the speed of the block as it passes through the mean position shown.</p>\n<img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/@width/image/6y3zli1mrkemxs3/cbc13a02-3f9b-4025-bac5-f244ee7aa717/29855d30-7f60-11f1-92fa-31956cdeded5/file-6y3zli1mrkemxs4.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1mrkemxs3/cbc13a02-3f9b-4025-bac5-f244ee7aa717/29855d30-7f60-11f1-92fa-31956cdeded5/file-6y3zli1mrkemxs4.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width: 100%;height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;max-height: 40vh;vertical-align: baseline\">",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "identifier": "A",
                    "content": "<p>$\\sqrt{\\frac{k_1 + k_2}{m}}x$</p>"
                  },
                  {
                    "identifier": "B",
                    "content": "<p>$\\sqrt{\\frac{k_1 k_2}{m(k_1 + k_2)}}x$</p>"
                  },
                  {
                    "identifier": "C",
                    "content": "<p>$\\sqrt{\\frac{k_1^2 k_2^2}{m(k_1^2 + k_2^2)}}x$</p>"
                  },
                  {
                    "identifier": "D",
                    "content": "<p>$\\sqrt{\\frac{k_1^3 k_2^3}{m(k_1^3 + k_2^3)}}x$</p>"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "hi": {
                "comprehension": null,
                "direction": null,
                "content": "<p>चित्रानुसार द्रव्यमान m का एक गुटका स्प्रिंग नियतांक $k_1$ तथा $k_2$ वाले दो बिना खिंचे स्प्रिंगों से जुड़ा है। गुटके को दायीं ओर $x$ दूरी तक विस्थापित करके छोड़ दिया जाता है। जब यह प्रदर्शित माध्य स्थिति से गुजरता है, तो गुटके की चाल ज्ञात कीजिए।</p>\n<img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/@width/image/6y3zli1mrkemxs3/cbc13a02-3f9b-4025-bac5-f244ee7aa717/29855d30-7f60-11f1-92fa-31956cdeded5/file-6y3zli1mrkemxs4.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1mrkemxs3/cbc13a02-3f9b-4025-bac5-f244ee7aa717/29855d30-7f60-11f1-92fa-31956cdeded5/file-6y3zli1mrkemxs4.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width: 100%;height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;max-height: 40vh;vertical-align: baseline\">",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "identifier": "A",
                    "content": "<p>$\\sqrt{\\frac{k_1 + k_2}{m}}x$</p>"
                  },
                  {
                    "identifier": "B",
                    "content": "<p>$\\sqrt{\\frac{k_1 k_2}{m(k_1 + k_2)}}x$</p>"
                  },
                  {
                    "identifier": "C",
                    "content": "<p>$\\sqrt{\\frac{k_1^2 k_2^2}{m(k_1^2 + k_2^2)}}x$</p>"
                  },
                  {
                    "identifier": "D",
                    "content": "<p>$\\sqrt{\\frac{k_1^3 k_2^3}{m(k_1^3 + k_2^3)}}x$</p>"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
