              "en": {
                "comprehension": null,
                "direction": null,
                "content": "<p>A running man has half the kinetic energy of that of a boy of half of his mass. The man speeds up by 1 m/s so as to have same kinetic energy as that of the boy. The original speed of the man will be</p>",
